From 522a6bdf36b78cecf24741d91f900c74a99eb658 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hoangvu12 <hggaming91@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 20:53:23 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] nightly: zgx with Windows' glass, caption colours and the
 cursor, GetDC, text and input fixes

Points v3's zgx at hoangvu12/zgx nightly/v3-zgx (d8b7c6ca). That is
zeron/zgx's pin (57735144) plus zeronsh/zgx#1495 and #1496, zgx's fix
for the cursor under pointer_events none, #1500 (popup cursor, GetDC
leak), #1516 (text below 2x on whole pixels), #1531 (a fast drag no
longer holds back painting) and #1539 (no silent quit when an input
method asks about a removed editor). Drop this once zeron/zgx pins a
zgx with all of them.
